WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.387
Your app idea

00:00:01.423 --> 00:00:02.000
sent to a

00:00:01.812 --> 00:00:02.885
server silently

00:00:03.414 --> 00:00:04.510
A GitHub issue

00:00:04.322 --> 00:00:05.748
reports that Convex's

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.105
quickstart skills quietly

00:00:06.916 --> 00:00:07.883
send a user's

00:00:07.695 --> 00:00:08.590
app idea to

00:00:08.402 --> 00:00:09.487
a remote host

00:00:09.664 --> 00:00:10.737
then run remote

00:00:10.548 --> 00:00:11.468
scripts there

00:00:11.998 --> 00:00:13.047
The scripts run

00:00:12.859 --> 00:00:13.684
without telling the

00:00:13.496 --> 00:00:14.486
user and the

00:00:14.309 --> 00:00:15.205
issue says they

00:00:15.017 --> 00:00:15.795
are written to

00:00:15.607 --> 00:00:17.092
avoid safety checks

00:00:17.198 --> 00:00:17.965
so the user

00:00:17.776 --> 00:00:18.872
never sees what

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:19.851
leaves their machine

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:21.321
The report is

00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:22.064
now filed as

00:00:21.947 --> 00:00:23.373
issue sixty-four against

00:00:23.185 --> 00:00:24.434
the Convex backend

00:00:24.246 --> 00:00:25.661
skills repository

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:27.204
Full story on

00:00:27.015 --> 00:00:27.911
the dashboard
